    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24785b182332128d1dcd07c5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "人气第十八是%ban1%h_pop18",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d7222f5cc5317c9e31c5312bea0a9e783c237baffd51c61707b0030dbcebed1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a498637459e256e6153861fc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%ban1%h_pop18，人气第十八",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf533e7303917454bcc50329ce1a968e46c35dd0daee5e1e34fcfb08fadc8fd4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3f73761a986e49cd3395be6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "特别周实现了梦想！\n她终于实现了德比赛马娘的梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebebc815a0ab287ef01ccc3bc3f1a999f0a30f5373c20df6b7a924bd84e68ff8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36c4ba574bfd4b9f05734c7f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "荣光星期日的主角是无声铃鹿！\n从第四弯道起点就已经分出胜负\n她成功取得了盾之荣誉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c47873d3d1b31236ba9ec1bd93b9b14b244828145aed7c1d21463a3e801f5e2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31f623d5a24eef8bc4e66fa7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征所达成的无败皋月赏制霸！\n东海帝王也抵达了那个轨迹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9bfe229b632954f23d7874728feced4d13d2aa25c2c07b089774d2d6b8c1564",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3991030144b80e37d36734aa",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基领先！\n这差距或许连缩小一丝都做不到！\n丸善斯基，太强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6bd7676d07316b2df240b055f76c89983e86a4eb7e9789a141bf5690899a3e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71984c7bcbca8f7b959679ce",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "小栗第一名！　小栗第一名！\n精彩地回应了粉丝们的欢呼声！\n她就是超级赛马娘，她就是小栗帽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db7867335685a5b03226e60b1034b152f0945bdbc80b4d1bd846f2da074bbef3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b2dfb5881d7a0d3b8933a7a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "黄金船！\n继皋月和菊花之后，在大奖赛中\n也精彩地揽下了金牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b771e4434035fa3887130e39ca0bfc28deb456c1a9135ae224639e14eb85f60",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1f9e51750c8209807631ec",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "伏特加领先！　终于实现了德比赛马娘的梦想！\n伏特加精彩地将其化作现实！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1782c441493c45a946477d43596deb9888137a0b49c5ac982f8e4426235e9e36",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6103d92e484b4f5e0dc7b0a9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是大和赤骥！\n梦想之门现在敞开！　从三后冠路线开始\n毫无疑问的大奖赛制霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c6a625539f53c1f7be61a8b77bb3bf5ac5d9db81f7e61d15d6a1ee076c1e8ed",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f34392ffa629fbce61231b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "大树快车好强！　毫无疑问是大树快车！\n压倒性的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e191819d923bf63b70f3f8fbf9779b3df94bcb89e88d00dd4c8b37fcb4ed7e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b46fbb170cd56b26bd09f28",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "强者果然就是强者！\n尽管特别周很强，\n但草上飞更胜一筹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "916c261df77d6dfa34a7c8883abf308c8e601c9838ced740955a2ca86e977897",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cc511cbad782eacb6641cbe",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "麦昆！是麦昆！！\n是目白，但却是麦昆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "828a489c49fc667211418fb14bc4ebfeb3280f8168aa94e49d951665bc8aba45",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4071"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
